# Source cleanup phase 4 (front-end naming, 2026-11-16), NHL 96 PC: input of tools/build/split_modules.py, run in steps
# as the files get named (one step per block). Only text moves; ./build.sh must print MATCH.
# step 1: front_10010, the link library
rename front/front_10010 front/controls Controls: keyboard, mouse and joystick pads, the key bindings and the Gravis GrIP library (96 PC).
cut ModemGameOpen front/modem_game Modem game session: open, connect and close a modem game, sync points, blocks, pad input exchange and the chat box (96 PC).
cut ModemInitDefault front/link Modem commands (AT) and the serial link protocol: packets, acks and resends, the link timer (96 PC).
rename front/main front/link
cut sub_18E80 front/main Front-end main: start-up, async and CD streaming, text edit fields and screen helpers (to be split as they get named).
# step 2: front_1456D
rename front/front_1456D front/postgame Post-game screens: the three stars and the game statistics (96 PC).
cut PlayMenuGame front/play_game Playing a game: from the menus by game mode, the input record timer, the game loop, the demo game (95 PC front/main, 96 PC).
# step 3: front/main (18E80-201CD)
rename front/main front/team_ranks Team ranks by power play and penalty kill % for the pre-game screen (96 PC).
cut NameIndexNew front/name_index NAMEINDEX files: the index of saved files in a directory (names, titles, ids) (96 PC).
cut EditText front/edit_text Text entry field (96 PC).
cut DrawBoxButton front/message_box Message boxes: with buttons, without, and with a progress bar (96 PC).
cut LoadTeamLogo front/main Front-end main: main_, start-up and shut-down, the front-end screen loop, team logos (96 PC).
cut setasyncspeed front/async EA async file reader: request queue, read rate, timer (EA library, names from its debug messages).
cut CdStreamInit front/cdstream EA CD stream: ring-buffered data streams off the CD (EA library, names from its debug messages).
cut BlankForFadeIn front/game_setup Setting up a game: players at the start, SetupGame, SetupDemoGame, the game variables (95 PC front/main).
cut FileMissing front/file_io DOS file helpers: open, create, close, read / write at an offset, copy, delete (96 PC).
cut IsCupClinched front/series Playoff series: the Cup or a series clinched (96 PC).
cut MakeDataPath front/data_files Game data files: their paths by id and directory, loading them (96 PC).
cut LoadSeasonStats front/stats_tables The stats tables of the game mode: loading and freeing them (96 PC).
cut EndGameCleanup front/game_teams The teams of a game: rosters and lines from the mode's files, the end-of-game clean-up (96 PC).
# step 4: front_201CD
rename front/front_201CD front/pad_setup GrIP pad set-up screen and the joystick test screen (96 PC).
cut sub_21990 front/rink_model 3D rink: the ice and boards model, its textures and the software 3D renderer of the 96 rink view (96 PC; to be split as it gets named).
rename front/rink_model front/rink_model
# step 5: front_2A692, the users part of rink_model's tail
cut unk_2A3D6 front/users User records: LOCAL.NDX of user names, the user record files, picking users for the controllers, the user records screen (96 PC).
rename front/front_2A692 front/users
# step 6: front_67000, sound
rename front/front_67000 front/speech Announcer speech: SPEECHBUF, the speech bank files, the 24-clip speech queue and the play-by-play events PaEvent queues clips for (96 PC).
cut StopMusic front/music Music on the CD stream: queue, play, fade, stop and feed it (96 PC).
cut StopAllSfx front/sound Digital sound effects, crowd noise, arena clips, the sound card start-up, the game and front-end sound banks and the sound idle call (96 PC).
cut TgvClock front/movie TGV movies: open the movie and its audio stream, decode and show the frames, play a movie file between screens (96 PC).
cut ReadGlobalSet front/settings GLOBAL.SET, the settings file SETUP writes, read at start and written back; the EXHIBIT.NDX start of the front-end menus (96 PC).
cut RunInGameMenu front/pause_menu The in-game menu: RunInGameMenu and the pause menu screens of a game (96 PC; its routines still to be named).
# step 7: front_584A0, the game view
rename front/front_584A0 front/game_view The 3D game view: set-up and frame draw, shading LUT, player and puck sprites, controller markers, the game overlays (clock, power play, panels) and the line change boxes (96 PC).
cut CameraPathCoeffs front/camera The game camera: its path polynomials and the camera shots (96 PC).
# step 8: front_5D993 (camera, sprite art, front-end art, intro, drawing helpers) and front_64F59 (menus)
rename front/front_5D993 front/camera
cut PutJerseyDigit front/player_art Player sprite art: the sprite banks (fight.ref, total.ref, oldshp.qfs, cup.ref), the UNPACK frame cache, team palettes, jersey colours and numbers (96 PC).
cut LoadFrontEndArt front/screen_art Front-end screen art: load and free it, team name images, the screen frame and its sliding bars (96 PC).
cut PlayIntroMovies front/intro The intro at start-up (screens and movies) and the slide shows, the credits at shut-down (96 PC).
cut BlackPalette front/draw Drawing helpers: palette fades, the graphics mode, bitmap copies, text in colours, boxes, colour remapping (96 PC).
cut InitMenuItems front/menu Menus: the menu items, the menu input (mouse, pads, joysticks, keys) and its sounds, the menu loop (96 PC; still to be named).
rename front/front_64F59 front/menu
